stateDiagram-v2
  accTitle: Field reconciliation - all six persisted pair states
  accDescr: New, synced and due retry pairs are evaluated. Conflicts, dead work and pending approval require explicit action. Evaluation is transient, not a seventh stored status.
  direction TB
  state "new" as New
  state "synced" as Synced
  state "retry" as Retry
  state "conflict" as Conflict
  state "dead" as Dead
  state "awaiting_approval" as Review
  state "Evaluate fresh evidence" as Evaluate

  [*] --> New: mapping saved
  New --> Evaluate: sweep
  Synced --> Evaluate: next sweep
  Retry --> Evaluate: retry due
  Evaluate --> Synced: target verified
  Evaluate --> Review: state approval missing
  Evaluate --> Conflict: stale / divergent / mismatch
  Evaluate --> Retry: temporary failure
  Evaluate --> Dead: permanent / fifth failure
  Review --> New: fresh exact approval
  Review --> Conflict: source changed at approval
  Conflict --> New: fresh source choice
  Conflict --> Conflict: source changed at choice
  Dead --> New: explicit retry
  Retry --> New: explicit retry

  note right of Evaluate
    Key: lower-case states are persisted.
    Evaluate is transient; skipped is a pass outcome.
  end note
  note right of Review
    Approval queues work without a vendor write.
    Source selection never grants approval.
  end note
